# CodeGraph data files — local to each machine, not for committing.
# Ignore everything in .codegraph/ except this file itself, so transient
# files (the database, daemon.pid, sockets, logs) never show up in git.
#
# EXCEPT here. This is T-01's fixture target, the one place in this repo whose
# index is committed on purpose (see /.gitignore's `!tests/fixtures/target/
# .codegraph/` carve-out and commit 880a58c). codegraph rewrites this file on
# every `init`, and a bare `*` silently overrides that carve-out: nested
# .gitignore rules beat parent ones, so the fixture index would stop being
# tracked the moment anyone re-added it. Keep the negation below.
*
!.gitignore
!codegraph.db
